# This repository is LF throughout. Python's text mode writes CRLF on Windows,
# so a scripted edit silently rewrote every line of the files it touched and
# turned a twenty-three line change into an eight-hundred line diff. This
# settles it at the git boundary rather than relying on every tool behaving.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ...except what is not text. Marked so git never looks inside them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.otf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
